                        "entry_id": "7be5fe2e-91ba-32d1-a1b5-a8d115782d18",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A committee formed by an existing committee, comprising a subset of its members."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bd28f77-45bc-4e8c-bd69-5ce0d844fc48",
                                "sense_id": "966ce44a-e446-358e-b3f2-8b4337c2cb66",
                                "text": "The society's museum sub-committee is aiming to gather narrow-gauge railway exhibits from throughout the British Isles, and further accommodation will be provided to house the growing collection."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2cc1ad1-add1-4abe-84e3-5e638e82e12e",
                                "sense_id": "966ce44a-e446-358e-b3f2-8b4337c2cb66",
                                "text": "Have you ever seen the televised St. Vitus subcommittee prize"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cef8e65e-b8df-45cf-8173-1f092b14d681",
                                "sense_id": "966ce44a-e446-358e-b3f2-8b4337c2cb66",
                                "text": "“We all know that this is a second-best option” said Michigan Rep. Elissa Slotkin, who chairs one of the Homeland Security subcommittees under Thompson."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e27385f-b52a-4da3-b8a7-76549ccfd154",
                                "sense_id": "966ce44a-e446-358e-b3f2-8b4337c2cb66",
                                "text": "The subcommittee report says that if evidence of the virus’ natural origin existed, it would have surfaced by now."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
